--------------------------------------------------------------------------
PORTED FILES AND STATEMENT OF MODIFICATIONS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

The following files are **ports of Go source from Agent Orchestrator**, read at
commit `53ba1e8` ("fix(models): show agent default instead of \"Model not
reported\" (#6063)"). Each ported file carries a header naming its source file.

  Ported file                              Source file
  ---------------------------------------  ------------------------------------
  src/contract/status.js                   backend/pkg/contract/status.go
  src/contract/activity.js                 backend/internal/domain/activity.go
  src/contract/kanban.js                   backend/pkg/contract/kanban.go
  src/review/planner.js                    backend/internal/review/planner.go
  src/review/gate.js                       backend/internal/autoreview/coordinator.go

Modifications applied to every ported file:

  1. **Language.** Go is translated to JavaScript (ESM, zero dependencies).
     Struct fields become object properties; Go's PascalCase becomes camelCase.
     `time.Time` becomes an epoch-milliseconds number. Go's "zero value"
     defaults (empty string / false / zero number) are reproduced by the
     `blank*` normalizers so that a missing property behaves exactly like a Go
     zero value.

  2. **Error-returning paths.** Functions that return `(T, bool)` map to a value
     or `undefined`. Panics do not exist in the ported surface.

  3. **Deliberate divergences are labelled `DIVERGENCE` in the code.** They are
     listed in `STATUS.md` under "Documented divergences". As of this writing
     there is exactly one behavioural divergence in the ported reducer:
     `requireHumanApprovalBeforeReady` (PRD §7.6 rows 5b and 6), which adds a
     guaranteed human gate that Agent Orchestrator does not have.

  4. **Ported code is behaviour-preserving except where a divergence is
     labelled.** The ported reducer's truth table is covered by a JavaScript
     translation of Agent Orchestrator's own test cases
     (test/contract/kanban.test.js, ported from backend/pkg/contract/kanban_test.go)
     so that a porting bug cannot hide behind a rewrite.
